  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive city: making Hanoi livable for the most marginalized groups of migrant workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support migrant workers to improve their neighbourhood and social status as a way to make Hanoi more inclusive and livable for all. 

The project aims at two key results as follow: 

Result 1: The neighbourhood of a floating village and migrants-concentrated areas near Red River is improved 

Result 2: Narrative on migrant workers as an integral part of Hanoi is enriched and spread through mass media and social media.</narrative>
  </description>
